  "lessons": [
    {
      "file": "course-app/content/hsk3/lesson-17.json",
      "sha256": "244aa2c25d66d7168b4dff8c5431e200fed68d6c2d54af530e0781c7772bfe2a",
      "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17",
      "source": {
        "startPdfPage": 166,
        "endPdfPage": 174,
        "startPrintedPage": 154,
        "endPrintedPage": 162
      },
      "texts": [
        {
          "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text1",
          "audioTrack": "17-1",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text1:line1",
              "zh": "别再向前走了，李老师的办公室已经到了。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 167,
                "printedPage": 155,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text1:line2",
              "zh": "你进去吧，我在楼梯那儿等你。我害怕见李老师。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 167,
                "printedPage": 155,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text1:line3",
              "zh": "怎么回事？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 167,
                "printedPage": 155,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text1:line4",
              "zh": "最近我做错了好几件事，我怕李老师生气。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 167,
                "printedPage": 155,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text1:line5",
              "zh": "你想多了，做错事情是很常见的。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 167,
                "printedPage": 155,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text1:line6",
              "zh": "我把简单的事情做错了，李老师一定觉得我不认真。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 167,
                "printedPage": 155,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text1:line7",
              "zh": "有的人虽然很聪明，但是会在简单的事情中出错，因为他们认为事情简单，就不会认真去做了。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 167,
                "printedPage": 155,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text1:line8",
              "zh": "你说的就是我，以后我要多向认真的人学习。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 167,
                "printedPage": 155,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text2",
          "audioTrack": "17-3",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text2:line1",
              "zh": "太阳从西边出来了？这几天怎么总是在图书馆看见你？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 169,
                "printedPage": 157,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text2:line2",
              "zh": "这有什么奇怪的？我是来学习的。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 169,
                "printedPage": 157,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text2:line3",
              "zh": "你怎么还来图书馆学习？同学们都在到处找工作呢。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 169,
                "printedPage": 157,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text2:line4",
              "zh": "我不想现在就工作，还想继续学习，我爸妈也同意。可我还没想好学什么，所以来图书馆看看。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 169,
                "printedPage": 157,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text2:line5",
              "zh": "你不是喜欢玩电脑吗？你可以去看看跟电脑有关系的书。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 169,
                "printedPage": 157,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text2:line6",
              "zh": "你说得对，我记得那个屋子里有些跟电脑有关的书，我去找找。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 169,
                "printedPage": 157,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text3",
          "audioTrack": "17-5",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text3:line1",
              "zh": "天中，你的手机怎么关机了？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 170,
                "printedPage": 158,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text3:line2",
              "zh": "我的手机没电了。你找我有事吗？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 170,
                "printedPage": 158,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text3:line3",
              "zh": "前天我看见家月了，她告诉我你打算继续留学？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 170,
                "printedPage": 158,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text3:line4",
              "zh": "是，可是我还没想好学什么，更没想好去哪个国家。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 170,
                "printedPage": 158,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text3:line5",
              "zh": "你可以去中国学中文啊。比如可以去北京、上海这样的大城市，那里有很多好大学，也有很多留学生。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 170,
                "printedPage": 158,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text3:line6",
              "zh": "好，那我上网查一查。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 170,
                "printedPage": 158,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text3:line7",
              "zh": "我给你介绍几个有用的网站。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 170,
                "printedPage": 158,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text4",
          "audioTrack": "17-7",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l17:text4:line1",
              "zh": "大学生活马上就要结束了，我最近经常被问到一个问题——“你以后想做什么”，这个问题真不容易回答。我也问了几个同学，大家选择的方向都不同。有的想继续在学校学习，有的打算出国留学，还有的决定先找工作。我认为只有想清楚自己真正喜欢什么，才能做出最合适的选择。对我来说，想清楚“真正喜欢什么”是个难题。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 172,
                "printedPage": 160,
                "section": "课文4",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
