    {
      "file": "course-app/content/hsk3/lesson-18.json",
      "sha256": "939dcb25ee7cdd124e062a2810fea523a9193395fd56fa940d8c111a554c0f53",
      "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18",
      "source": {
        "startPdfPage": 175,
        "endPdfPage": 185,
        "startPrintedPage": 163,
        "endPrintedPage": 173
      },
      "texts": [
        {
          "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text1",
          "audioTrack": "18-1",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text1:line1",
              "zh": "我要在中国过年，真开心。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 176,
                "printedPage": 164,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text1:line2",
              "zh": "第一次请外国朋友来家里过春节，我也很高兴。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 176,
                "printedPage": 164,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text1:line3",
              "zh": "你们怎样过节？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 176,
                "printedPage": 164,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text1:line4",
              "zh": "春节是中国最重要的节日，我们一般会回家，跟家人一起过。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 176,
                "printedPage": 164,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text1:line5",
              "zh": "那你跟家人会一起做什么？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 176,
                "printedPage": 164,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text1:line6",
              "zh": "我们家会一边包饺子，一边看春节联欢晚会，一直到十二点以后才睡觉。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 176,
                "printedPage": 164,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text1:line7",
              "zh": "听起来很有意思。春节放几天假？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 176,
                "printedPage": 164,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text1:line8",
              "zh": "大概七八天。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 176,
                "printedPage": 164,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text2",
          "audioTrack": "18-3",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text2:line1",
              "zh": "张阿姨，李叔叔。过年好！这是我准备的礼物，请收下。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 178,
                "printedPage": 166,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text2:line2",
              "zh": "谢谢家月，你太客气了！",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 178,
                "printedPage": 166,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text2:line3",
              "zh": "总听小文说起你，今天终于有机会见面了。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 178,
                "printedPage": 166,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text2:line4",
              "zh": "谢谢您和叔叔请我来家里做客。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 178,
                "printedPage": 166,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text2:line5",
              "zh": "桌子上有饮料，还有矿泉水，你想喝什么就自己拿。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 178,
                "printedPage": 166,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text2:line6",
              "zh": "你先坐着看会儿电视，饺子很快就包好了。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 178,
                "printedPage": 166,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text2:line7",
              "zh": "我刚刚看视频学会了包饺子，我跟你们一起包吧。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 178,
                "printedPage": 166,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text3",
          "audioTrack": "18-5",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text3:line1",
              "zh": "这张照片是李文出国前照的吗？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 180,
                "printedPage": 168,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text3:line2",
              "zh": "对，这是他从北京出发时，我们全家在机场照的。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 180,
                "printedPage": 168,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text3:line3",
              "zh": "那是三四年前吧？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 180,
                "printedPage": 168,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text3:line4",
              "zh": "是啊，时间过得真快，好像是不久前发生的一样。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 180,
                "printedPage": 168,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text3:line5",
              "zh": "您一定特别想李文吧？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 180,
                "printedPage": 168,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text3:line6",
              "zh": "他刚离开家时，我很不习惯，只要几天不跟他视频，就很想他。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 180,
                "printedPage": 168,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text3:line7",
              "zh": "还有最后一个学期就要毕业了，他很快就会回来了。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 180,
                "printedPage": 168,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text4",
          "audioTrack": "18-7",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text4:line1",
              "zh": "这次来中国，我最高兴的是认识了李文的父母。他们给我看了李文出生时的照片，还给我讲了很多他过去的故事。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 181,
                "printedPage": 169,
                "section": "课文4",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text4:line2",
              "zh": "李文高中的时候想学医，从那时起就努力学习。高三的时候，因为成绩特别好，他得到了出国留学的机会。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 181,
                "printedPage": 169,
                "section": "课文4",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk3-fltrp-2026:l18:text4:line3",
              "zh": "在他身上，我懂得了，只要一直坚持，就能完成自己的目标。我相信，他以后一定会发展得更好。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 181,
                "printedPage": 169,
                "section": "课文4",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
